    "well-insight-ui": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@well-insight/ui-mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

**Zed**（`settings.json` → `context_servers`）：

```json
{
  "context_servers": {
    "well-insight-ui": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@well-insight/ui-mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

**Continue**（`config.json` / YAML 中的 MCP servers，字段名以当前版本为准）：

```json
{
  "mcpServers": [
    {
      "name": "well-insight-ui",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@well-insight/ui-mcp"]
